{"content_hash": "9763b7657c5c99ef", "version_id": 774, "article_id": 78, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Jokić tells booing fans to stay away as Nuggets win in overtime", "title_zh": "约基奇怒怼嘘声球迷：别再来看了，掘金加时逆转鹈鹕", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/jokic-says-booing-fans-not-welcome-after-nuggets-rally-from-23-points-down-to-beat-pelicans", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722653-c611b7f78c32?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGpva2klMjBib29pbmclMjBmYW5zfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTI5NzA4NDV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-in-blue-and-white-uniform-on-stadium-_zukO8E8-bY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(325, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(3, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "219d721cfe25"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-26", "word_count": 240, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Nikola Jokić scored 35 points and led the Denver Nuggets back from 23 points down to beat the New Orleans Pelicans in overtime. After the game, he had strong words for fans who booed the team.", "lead_zh": "尼古拉·约基奇砍下35分，带领丹佛掘金在加时赛中逆转23分劣势，击败新奥尔良鹈鹕。赛后，他对嘘球队的球迷说了重话。", "preview": "Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as the short-handed Nuggets beat the Pelicans 141-135 o", "preview_zh": "约基奇在加时赛中拿下35分中的8分，并贡献15个篮板和10次助攻，帮助人手不足的掘金在周六晚上以141比135击败鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 754, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 90.875, "size_bytes": 546192, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 92.4, "size_bytes": 555408, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 99.725, "size_bytes": 599328, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 86.775, "size_bytes": 521568, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 91.75, "size_bytes": 551520, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@146f373/content/data/versions/774.json", "paragraphs": ["Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as the short-handed Nuggets beat the Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.", "Some home fans booed the Nuggets when they went into half-time 73-57 down. After the game, Jokić made his displeasure clear. \"Those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said. \"If you follow us, you know that we never quit and we've come back from much worse situations.\"", "Jamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille had seven of his 17 points in overtime in his home debut. His corner three-pointer with 1:25 left gave Denver a 133-129 lead. Denver played without several injured players, including Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo.", "Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22 and both Derik Queen and Zion Williamson scored 17. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.", "New Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half and led by 23 points. Denver cut the gap to 16 at one stage, and Jokić and Murray combined for 22 of the team's 32 points in the third quarter. The Nuggets then erased the deficit with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, before Murray tied the game with free throws."], "paragraphs_zh": ["约基奇在加时赛中拿下35分中的8分，并贡献15个篮板和10次助攻，帮助人手不足的掘金在周六晚上以141比135击败鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。", "半场结束时掘金以57比73落后，部分主场球迷对球队发出嘘声。赛后，约基奇明确表达了自己的不满。他说：“那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用再来了。如果你们关注我们，就知道我们从不放弃，而且我们曾从更糟的局面中翻盘。”", "贾马尔·穆雷砍下42分，新秀特雷文·布拉齐尔在主场首秀中加时独得17分中的7分。比赛还剩1分25秒时，他的底角三分帮助丹佛以133比129领先。掘金此役缺少多名伤员，包括卡姆·约翰逊和阿尔法·迪亚洛。", "特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分，德章泰·穆雷得到22分，德里克·奎因和锡安·威廉姆森各得17分。鹈鹕在首年执教的主帅贾马尔·莫斯利带领下已遭遇开局三连败。", "鹈鹕上半场命中率高达65.9%，一度领先23分。掘金曾将分差缩小到16分，约基奇和穆雷在第三节合计拿下全队32分中的22分。随后掘金依靠穆雷和约基奇的三分以及阿隆·戈登的反手扣篮抹平分差，并由穆雷罚球将比赛拖入加时。"], "body": "Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as the short-handed Nuggets beat the Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\n\nSome home fans booed the Nuggets when they went into half-time 73-57 down. After the game, Jokić made his displeasure clear. \"Those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said. \"If you follow us, you know that we never quit and we've come back from much worse situations.\"\n\nJamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille had seven of his 17 points in overtime in his home debut. His corner three-pointer with 1:25 left gave Denver a 133-129 lead. Denver played without several injured players, including Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo.\n\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22 and both Derik Queen and Zion Williamson scored 17. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.\n\nNew Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half and led by 23 points. Denver cut the gap to 16 at one stage, and Jokić and Murray combined for 22 of the team's 32 points in the third quarter. The Nuggets then erased the deficit with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, before Murray tied the game with free throws.", "body_zh": "约基奇在加时赛中拿下35分中的8分，并贡献15个篮板和10次助攻，帮助人手不足的掘金在周六晚上以141比135击败鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。\n\n半场结束时掘金以57比73落后，部分主场球迷对球队发出嘘声。赛后，约基奇明确表达了自己的不满。他说：“那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用再来了。如果你们关注我们，就知道我们从不放弃，而且我们曾从更糟的局面中翻盘。”\n\n贾马尔·穆雷砍下42分，新秀特雷文·布拉齐尔在主场首秀中加时独得17分中的7分。比赛还剩1分25秒时，他的底角三分帮助丹佛以133比129领先。掘金此役缺少多名伤员，包括卡姆·约翰逊和阿尔法·迪亚洛。\n\n特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分，德章泰·穆雷得到22分，德里克·奎因和锡安·威廉姆森各得17分。鹈鹕在首年执教的主帅贾马尔·莫斯利带领下已遭遇开局三连败。\n\n鹈鹕上半场命中率高达65.9%，一度领先23分。掘金曾将分差缩小到16分，约基奇和穆雷在第三节合计拿下全队32分中的22分。随后掘金依靠穆雷和约基奇的三分以及阿隆·戈登的反手扣篮抹平分差，并由穆雷罚球将比赛拖入加时。", "text": "Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as the short-handed Nuggets beat the Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209. Some home fans booed the Nuggets when they went into half-time 73-57 down. After the game, Jokić made his displeasure clear. \"Those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said. \"If you follow us, you know that we never quit and we've come back from much worse situations.\" Jamal Murray scored 42 points, and rookie Trevon Brazille had seven of his 17 points in overtime in his home debut. His corner three-pointer with 1:25 left gave Denver a 133-129 lead. Denver played without several injured players, including Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, while Dejounte Murray had 22 and both Derik Queen and Zion Williamson scored 17. The Pelicans have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley. New Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half and led by 23 points. Denver cut the gap to 16 at one stage, and Jokić and Murray combined for 22 of the team's 32 points in the third quarter. The Nuggets then erased the deficit with three-pointers and a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, before Murray tied the game with free throws.", "vocab": [{"word": "rally", "pos": "verb", "zh": "逆转；奋起直追", "note": "常与 from 连用，rally from 23 points down 表示从落后23分追回来", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "triple-double", "pos": "noun", "zh": "三双", "note": "篮球术语，指一场比赛三项数据上双", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "short-handed", "pos": "adj", "zh": "人手不足的；缺兵少将的", "note": "形容球队因伤病等原因缺少球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "boo", "pos": "verb", "zh": "嘘；喝倒彩", "note": "球迷表达不满的常见方式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "displeasure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "不满；不快", "note": "比 anger 更正式、更克制", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "debut", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首秀；首次登场", "note": "home debut 指主场首秀", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rookie", "pos": "noun", "zh": "新秀", "note": "指进入职业联赛第一年的球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overtime", "pos": "noun", "zh": "加时赛", "note": "常规时间打平后进行的额外比赛时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "erased the deficit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "抹平分差", "note": "deficit 指落后分数，erase 表示消除", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "free throw", "pos": "noun", "zh": "罚球", "note": "篮球术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dropped", "pos": "verb", "zh": "输掉（比赛）", "note": "口语中 drop a game 表示输球", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "first-year coach", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "第一年执教的主教练", "note": "指刚接手球队的教练", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jokić says booing fans ‘not welcome’ after Nuggets rally from 23 points down to beat Pelicans", "summary_original": "New Orleans Pelicans 135-141 Denver Nuggets (OT)\nNuggets fans showed displeasure at half-time\nNikola Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and finished with 15 rebounds and 10 assists, and the short-handed Denver Nuggets rallied from 23 points down to beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night.\nJokić had his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Jokić says booing fans ‘not welcome’ after Nuggets rally from 23 points down to beat Pelicans\nNew Orleans Pelicans 135-141 Denver Nuggets (OT)\nNuggets fans showed displeasure at half-time\nNikola Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and finished with 15 rebounds and 10 assists, and the short-handed Denver Nuggets rallied from 23 points down to beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night.\nJokić had his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\nSections of the Nuggets home crowd booed the team when they went into half-time 73-57 down. After the game, Jokić made his displeasure clear.\n“We got booed at our first home game, and I think those fans who booed us, they don’t need to come anymore,” Jokić said. “If you guys follow us, you know that we never quit and we’ve come back from much worse situations. So, if they ask me, they are not welcome anymore.”\nJamal Murray scored 42 points and rookie Trevon Brazille had seven of his 17 points in overtime in his home debut for Denver, which took an early lead in overtime. His corner three-pointer with 1:25 left in overtime gave the Nuggets a 133-129 lead.\nDenver played without Cam Johnson (ankle) and Alpha Diallo (sprained wrist) and continued to be without Julian Strawther and Spencer Jones.\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, Dejounte Murray had 22 points and Derik Queen and Zion Williamson scored 17 each. The Pelicans have dropped their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.\nNew Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half and led by 23. Denver rallied to cut it to 16, and Jokić and Murray combined to score 22 of the Nuggets’ 32 points in the third quarter but the Pelicans extended the lead to 19 heading into the fourth.\nDenver erased the deficit on three-pointers from Murray and Jokić, a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, and then had a chance to go ahead with 17 seconds left but Murray made two of three free throws to tie it.\nExplore more on these topics\nNBA\nNikola Jokić\nBasketball\nUS sports\nnews\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-25T23:27:24.188772", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Joki", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.645, "sm": 325, "em": 644, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "ć", "s": 0.645, "e": 0.725, "sm": 644, "em": 724, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "scored", "s": 0.725, "e": 1.012, "sm": 725, "em": 1012, "cs": 6, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "eight", "s": 1.012, "e": 1.137, "sm": 1012, "em": 1137, "cs": 13, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "of", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.212, "sm": 1137, "em": 1212, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "his", "s": 1.212, "e": 1.387, "sm": 1212, "em": 1387, "cs": 22, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "35", "s": 1.387, "e": 2.05, "sm": 1387, "em": 2049, "cs": 26, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "points", "s": 2.05, "e": 2.337, "sm": 2050, "em": 2337, "cs": 29, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "in", "s": 2.337, "e": 2.425, "sm": 2337, "em": 2424, "cs": 36, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "overtime", "s": 2.425, "e": 3.312, "sm": 2425, "em": 3312, "cs": 39, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "and", "s": 3.312, "e": 3.45, "sm": 3312, "em": 3450, "cs": 48, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "added", "s": 3.45, "e": 3.76